    "expose": [],
    "Layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EDevelopment proposals \u003Cstrong\u003Eshould \u003C/strong\u003Eintegrate trees into new developments, where the initial steps involve prioritizing tree retention, understanding site constraints, and incorporating trees throughout the planning and design process. This includes assessing existing trees, planning for their successful integration, and considering tree replacement when necessary. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFurther principles are set out within the First Steps in Trees and New Developments which is downloadable from the Trees and Design Action Group (TDAG) website.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </description>
